<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7530] .NET: Poor performance &amp; excessive memory usage in GetAll and query cursors in binary mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7530</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GetAll&lt;/tt&gt; and query cursors do not use &lt;tt&gt;BinaryReader.DetachNext&lt;/tt&gt;. So in binary mode for each binary object in a stream we copy entire stream content, see &lt;tt&gt;BinaryReader.ReadAsBinary&lt;/tt&gt;, which calls &lt;tt&gt;Stream.GetArray()&lt;/tt&gt;, which causes copying in &lt;tt&gt;PlatformMemoryStream&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13133656">IGNITE-7530</key>
            <summary>.NET: Poor performance &amp; excessive memory usage in GetAll and query cursors in binary mode</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="3" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg">Major</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="1">Fixed</resolution>
